/P 950 0 R
/ActualText (This research explores the  Potential solutions in terms of energy storage options are imperative to create a balance between the locally available RES and the load profile of the community because energy storage is a key factor in the continuity of energy supply to the community. Among different energy storage options, hydrogen storage is considered to be a crucial option because of its high energy density, and hydrogen being the most common element in the universe is incarnated with satisfactory energy storage capability.[2])
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
